<title>NETHERLANDS: VAN DORP IN LOSS, SKIPS DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>VAN DORP IN LOSS, SKIPS DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 3.6  vs   2.5 profit</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  nil  vs   0.65</p>
<p>    Turnover			     237.7  vs 251.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.9  vs   7.9</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     3.1  vs   3.5</p>
<p>    Tax					1.2  vs   1.9</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 5.97 vs   0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Office equipment firm Van Dorp Groep NV said in</p>
<p>October it expected to suffer a loss in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
